Expose user-scoped redacted history and rollback as a fresh revision through validation and apply. Require expected active revision and current authority. Never restore revoked secrets/grants silently. Acceptance: successful and failed rollback, stale request, missing secret, cross-user revision ID and audit attribution covered; activation status remains truthful.
